{"unit_id":"b5ca4208deacf500a660","title":"三、 案由：健保署為長期使用非類固醇抗發炎劑藥品(Non-Steroidal","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b1","raw_text":"三、 案由：健保署為長期使用非類固醇抗發炎劑藥品(Non-Steroidal \n","start_char":0,"end_char":40,"bbox":[78.02400207519531,47.533790588378906,549.3602294921875,63.27262878417969]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b2","raw_text":"anti-inflammatory，NSAIDs)病人之用藥安全，函請本會提供意\n","start_char":0,"end_char":41,"bbox":[148.94000244140625,69.69036865234375,545.9498901367188,85.23265075683594]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b3","raw_text":"見案。(提案人：黃主任委員啓嘉) \n","start_char":0,"end_char":18,"bbox":[148.94000244140625,91.67034912109375,358.05999755859375,107.21263122558594]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b4","raw_text":"決議： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[106.33999633789062,113.7503662109375,151.84999084472656,129.2926483154297]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b5","raw_text":"(三) 建議NSAIDs不宜開立慢性連續處方箋。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":26,"bbox":[146.05999755859375,135.51376342773438,417.94000244140625,151.2526092529297]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b6","raw_text":"(四) 本會建議： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[146.05999755859375,157.47378540039062,243.67999267578125,173.21263122558594]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b7","raw_text":"1. 長期服用NSAIDs藥品，「長期」是指3個月以上。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,179.55380249023438,485.0500183105469,195.2926483154297]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b8","raw_text":"2. CKD第3期病人應每半年監測一次，第3B、4期應每3個月監\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,201.51376342773438,545.9799194335938,217.2526092529297]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b9","raw_text":"測一次。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":6,"bbox":[181.4600067138672,223.67034912109375,241.0399932861328,239.21263122558594]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b10","raw_text":"3. 長期服用NSAIDs藥品之病人，依據英國NICE治療指引建議\n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,245.55380249023438,545.9492797851562,261.29266357421875]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b11","raw_text":"監控eGFR。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":9,"bbox":[181.4600067138672,267.7403564453125,260.4800109863281,283.28265380859375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b12","raw_text":"(五) 有關「是否修訂於藥品給付規定一事」及「現行針對慢性腎臟\n","start_char":0,"end_char":32,"bbox":[146.05999755859375,289.5037536621094,545.937255859375,305.24261474609375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b13","raw_text":"病第3B、4、5期病人，於3個月內所有使用口服NSAIDs藥品總\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,311.78033447265625,545.9736328125,327.3226318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b14","raw_text":"日數≧31日之案件進行抽審，是否應將Early-CKD病人納入併\n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,333.7403259277344,545.964599609375,349.2826232910156]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b15","raw_text":"同管理一事」，建議提至健保署相關會議中討論。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":24,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,355.7003479003906,474.7300109863281,371.2426452636719]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b16","raw_text":"(六) 其他建議： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":11,"bbox":[146.05999755859375,377.5837707519531,243.67999267578125,393.3226318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b17","raw_text":"1. CKD第5期病人eGFR<15不宜使用NSAIDs藥品。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":33,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,399.54376220703125,479.0500183105469,415.2826232910156]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b18","raw_text":"2. 北區分會建議NSAID控管應排除不易影響腎功能的外用藥\n","start_char":0,"end_char":31,"bbox":[170.17999267578125,421.5037841796875,545.6362915039062,437.2426452636719]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b19","raw_text":"膏、噴劑、貼布。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":10,"bbox":[181.4600067138672,443.78033447265625,296.96002197265625,459.3226318359375]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-6d546d5f7090f8d11ae4-p3-b20","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[148.94000244140625,465.7603454589844,152.4499969482422,481.3026428222656]}],"source_quality":[]}